Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Product Manager",
      "description": "person responsible for defining features and steering platform direction"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Roadmap",
      "description": "plan outlining upcoming platform features and improvements",
      "attributes": [
        "Feature"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Feature",
      "description": "individual platform capability planned or delivered"
    },
    {
      "name": "User Feedback",
      "description": "input from users about their experience or feature needs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Content Moderator",
      "description": "person who reviews and manages platform content"
    },
    {
      "name": "Post",
      "description": "user generated content shared on the platform",
      "attributes": [
        "Comment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Comment",
      "description": "user response or remark attached to a post"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review",
      "description": "evaluation step performed on content for compliance or quality"
    },
    {
      "name": "User",
      "description": "platform participant who creates and interacts with content",
      "attributes": [
        "User Account",
        "Usage Data"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "User Account",
      "description": "profile and identity container for a user"
    },
    {
      "name": "Usage Data",
      "description": "record of user actions and behavior on the platform"
    },
    {
      "name": "Flag",
      "description": "marker indicating content or accounts requiring attention"
    },
    {
      "name": "Security Team",
      "description": "group responsible for handling misuse or suspicious activity"
    },
    {
      "name": "Community",
      "description": "organized group of users and related interactions",
      "attributes": [
        "Community Manager",
        "Discussion"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Community Manager",
      "description": "person who manages community interactions and activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Discussion",
      "description": "conversation thread between users"
    },
    {
      "name": "Campaign",
      "description": "organized community activity promoting engagement"
    },
    {
      "name": "User Inquiry",
      "description": "message from a user requesting help or information"
    },
    {
      "name": "Data Analyst",
      "description": "person who interprets platform metrics and user behavior"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Report",
      "description": "compiled data summary of platform performance",
      "attributes": [
        "Platform Metrics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Metrics",
      "description": "quantitative indicators of platform performance"
    }
  ]
}
```

Help me find the associations.  

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

